WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.520 --> 00:00:04.340
a suspect is in custody in connection with
the stabbing deaths of Ford University of

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:09.670
Idaho students last month authorities sorted
through thousands of tips and tracked Brian

00:00:09.670 --> 00:00:14.750
coburger more than 2 000 miles away from the
murder scene to his parents home in Pennsylvania's

00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:20.310
Pocono Mountains as Donya Backus reports police
are trying to determine a motive for the killings

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:27.179
what I can tell you is we have a individual
in custody who committed these horrible crimes

00:00:27.179 --> 00:00:32.430
after 19 000 tips in a quadruple murder case
that Drew Nationwide attention detectives

00:00:32.430 --> 00:00:40.010
arrested 28 year old Brian Christopher coburger
coburger was arrested at his parents Pennsylvania

00:00:40.010 --> 00:00:45.620
home the 28 year old is a PhD criminology
student at Washington State University just

00:00:45.620 --> 00:00:50.870
a 10-minute drive to the Idaho campus kohlberg
is being held without bail and will spend

00:00:50.870 --> 00:00:56.289
the weekend in Pennsylvania his extradition
back to Idaho expected next week the arrest

00:00:56.289 --> 00:01:01.850
caps nearly seven weeks of fear and frustration
for families of the four murdered students

00:01:01.850 --> 00:01:07.890
this is the first bit of joy that we've had
in close to seven weeks we hope that there's

00:01:07.890 --> 00:01:12.390
they've picked they've picked the right guy
and that gives us hope and we haven't had

00:01:12.390 --> 00:01:19.350
hope for a long time Kaylee Gonzalez Madison
mojin Zana Cardinal and Ethan Chapin All stabbed

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:24.500
multiple times as they slept and inside this
house near the campus despite surveillance

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:29.070
video showing the victims in the hours before
they were murdered and despite thousands of

00:01:29.070 --> 00:01:34.530
tips pouring into the Moscow police department
they appeared at least publicly to be little

00:01:34.530 --> 00:01:41.350
movement on the case no suspects no arrest
as the grief mounted and many students left

00:01:41.350 --> 00:01:50.000
campus outside the house the caution tape
has finally come down no arrest will ever

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.380
bring back these young students however we
do believe Justice will be found through the

00:01:55.380 --> 00:02:00.320
criminal process the district attorney who
will eventually prosecute kerberger once he's

00:02:00.320 --> 00:02:04.850
back in Idaho says an arrest does not mean
an end to the investigation they are still

00:02:04.850 --> 00:02:09.950
